# 014 · The quick start, tested in CI

**Status:** `READY` · **Version:** [v0.1.0](../roadmap.md#v010) · **Part:** Install from images · **Depends on:** [005](005-sample-project.goal), [011](011-release-bundle.goal)

## What

A CI job follows the quick start on a clean runner: start from the release bundle, run the rig checks, and run the sample campaign to its first verdict.

## Why

A broken quick start must fail the build, not a tester's first hour.

## Done when

- [ ] The job runs on every pull request and fails when the quick start breaks.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

None.

